  unitName: Strategist Weiss
  unitId: 40022
  unitNumber: 35
  description: A tactician from the ruined Atharva Republic. He was criticized for
    never appearing at the front, but he paid no mind to such comments and continued
    his command. After the war with the gods began, he would annihilate his enemies
    with his magic. This earned him admiration, but he was ashamed that he had been
    attacked, and recorded it as his greatest mistake.
  summonDesc: Summoning is an interesting art.<br>I will correctly make use<br>of
    your knowledge and skill.
  fusionDesc: Pay attention, even the <br>mightiest of warriors tend to<br>reveal
    their flaws.
  evoDesc: When the tactician must fight, the strategy has failed.
  element: 4
  rarity: 2
